---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About me"
	description="Shourya Kapoor: computer science student, builder, and writer, moving between Delhi and Dublin."
	pubDate={new Date('November 15 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Shourya Kapoor. I'm from Delhi, and I'm now doing an MSc in Computer Science
		(Intelligent Systems) at Trinity College Dublin. This is my final year there, and I want to
		spend it making things and putting my thinking where people can read it.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most of my time goes into building. Right now that means a small GPT-style language model
		written from scratch in PyTorch, with Claude Code as my pair programmer, and a dissertation
		comparing automated tools for testing REST APIs. I like understanding how things work under
		the hood, and I like writing down what I learn so the next person doesn't have to start from
		zero.
	</p>

	<p>
		Before this I spent a lot of time creating content on Instagram, which taught me how
		attention works online and how brands think about it. I'm not here to sell anything, though.
		This blog is for ideas.
	</p>

	<h2>What you'll find here</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Notes from building things: what worked, what broke, and what I'd do differently.</li>
		<li>Ideas about technology and society that I think are worth arguing about.</li>
		<li>Honest field notes on moving from Delhi to Dublin and studying AI.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<p>
		If something here made you think, or you think I've got it wrong, I'd like to hear it. You
		can find me on Instagram at
		<a href="https://www.instagram.com/shouryyakapoor/">@shouryyakapoor</a> and on
		<a href="https://github.com/ShouryaKapoor">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>